{"request_id":"sha256:d867e7b40da1c803c66fe8106b23dc7237e25b0337160fff60152293ca91e0b3","units":[{"unit_id":"sha256:5af948eb6210b0f7e047a83e111aaa2d045df14975f384e4393a2b97fa6a207d","reviewed":true,"findings":[{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":146}],"reason":"Forward-looking statement bullet listing an expectation about the number of microinverter units that can be produced per quarter; it is a forward-looking expectation, not a reported actual production quantity or a currently available capacity figure."},{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":282}],"reason":"Qualitative manufacturing disclosure: in November 2025 Enphase commenced manufacturing at its Arlington, Texas facility previously operated by Salcomp Manufacturing USA Corp.; this in-house facility together with the Flex contract manufacturer relationship provides strategic manufacturing capabilities and enhanced operational flexibility in the United States, and the company is currently shipping residential and commercial IQ Microinverters and IQ Batteries with higher domestic content from U.S.-based manufacturing facilities in South Carolina and Texas where several new production lines were added across the two sites. No numeric production or capacity quantity is stated."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":281}],"reason":"Manufacturing and supply chain description: the company outsources manufacturing of some products to third-party contract manufacturers (Flex Ltd. and affiliates, Salcomp Manufacturing India PVT and Sunwoda Electric Co. Ltd.) to assemble and test certain IQ microinverters, IQ Battery storage systems, EV chargers and IQ Gateway products; no production or capacity quantity is stated."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":306}],"reason":"Tariff and trade policy context: the company has relocated a significant portion of manufacturing to the United States while continuing to utilize contract manufacturing in China and India, with certain critical components still sourced outside the United States; no production or capacity quantity is stated."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":307}],"reason":"Supply chain context: LFP battery cells used in energy storage systems are still supplied exclusively by two vendors located in China, and alternative suppliers outside China are being explored; this concerns component sourcing, not a production or manufacturing capacity quantity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":202}],"reason":"Company overview context: as of December 31, 2025 the company has shipped approximately 86.4 million microinverters and more than 5.1 million Enphase residential and commercial systems have been deployed in over 160 countries; these are cumulative shipment and deployment figures, not actual production or available manufacturing capacity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":330}],"reason":"Human capital context: as of December 31, 2025 the company had 2,872 full-time employees, of which 148 were engaged in manufacturing; this is a headcount disclosure, not a production or capacity quantity."}],"unresolved":[]}]}